OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty sports centre costs council
OL,4,A#6k a week to secure
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn empty sports centre is costing
OL,7,FBradford Council more than #6,000 a
OL,8,Fweek to guard against trespassers and
OL,9,Fvandals.
OL,11,FThe extra security at the former
OL,12,FRichard Dunn Sports Centre was
OL,13,Fintroduced after a break-in earlier
OL,14,Fthis year.
OL,16,FThe costs have reignited a row over the
OL,17,Ffuture of the building, which closed in
OL,18,F2019. Plans to demolish it were halted
OL,19,Fwhen it was granted Grade II listed
OL,20,Fstatus in 2022 following a
OL,21,Frecommendation from Historic England.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
