OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty sports centre costs council
OL,4,A#6k a week to secure
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Debbie Davies said the
OL,7,Fbuilding was a "1970s eyesore" and said
OL,8,Fthe costs were a "nonsensical drain" on
OL,9,Ftaxpayers.
